|  | Flower | 96.76 | 68.57 | 96.14 |
|  | CUB-Bird | 88.40 | 56.84 | 83.60 |
| GPT-4o-mini | Car | 87.50 | 53.85 | 85.75 |
|  | Flower | 91.70 | 57.19 | 83.60 |
